    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "This application is filed for quashing the F.I.R. bearing Shastrinagar P.S. Case No. 61 of 2022 instituted for the offence under Sections 341, 342, 323, 354, 354-1, 504, 506/34 of the Indian Penal Code.",
