      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "From reading of the F.I.R., it appears that prima facie case is made out against the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2085,
      "end": 2182,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Therefore, the F.I.R. cannot be quashed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2183,
      "end": 2224,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Considering the aforesaid facts and also the law laid down by the Hon'ble Supreme Court in the case of M/S Neeharika Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd, Vs. State of Maharashtra and others reported in (2020) 10 SCC 118, this application is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2225,
      "end": 2465,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
